": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109203824", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993535832", "personaname": "Gargas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993535832/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 401, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 401, "last_played": 1637870174, "avatar": "f04a2c0cc9408b0250a7e9ccbc6314da4998bde5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not even a shadow of Left4Dead, the game is missing pretty much everything that gave L4D the atmosphere we loved.\n\nBuggy \"AI\"\nAnimations from the 90's in 5 fps.\nEven worse animations in multiplayer.\nNo/Poor lightning.\nNo variation.\nNo mood.\nNo suspense.\nPoor music, and poorly adapted to the situations.\nMany useless weapons, poor balance.\nPoor/illogical aim cones.\nThe ugliest molotov fires since gasoline was invented, this includes all games I've ever seen and real life.\nUgly zombies, low variation on animations.\nSame ♥♥♥♥♥♥ plastic ketchup blood splats over and over again, no enjoyment from shooting the zombies.\n\nThis can impossibly have come from any developer that did anything of consequence in L4D.\n\nA buggy shameless money grab in my opinion.\nWill avoid anything from these people in the future, launching this at full price shows a complete lack of respect for the customers.", "timestamp_created": 1643661022, "timestamp_updated": 1643661022, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495475441217422485", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109203015", "author": {"steamid": "76561198170206611", "personaname"